# A townsperson, look 2 (the Volga German), 1919: a farmhand of the
# "alemanes del Volga" who settled the pampa, about 50 (age 0.7), big and
# heavy-set, fair, with a full light-brown beard. A dun shirt, a dark
# waistcoat, wool trousers tucked into boots, a round-crowned felt hat
# and a brown woven poncho folded over his left shoulder against the
# cold. The game tints the shirt, waistcoat, trousers, hat and poncho per
# person.
#
# Lines MakeHuman does not know (it warns and skips them) are read by
# tools/mh2gltf.py: decimate and piece (see ../README.md). Credits in
# ../CREDITS.md.
